<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis AG 1996 profit up.</title>
<headline>Fortis AG 1996 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of Belgian francs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS AG --</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share (francs)	  355  vs  310</p>
<p>    Dividend (francs)			    127  vs  111</p>
<p>    Net profit (billion)		    13.5    vs  11.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands jointly own banking and insurance group Fortis. Analysts had forecast that Fortis AG would report a 1996 net profit of some 13.0 billion Belgian francs.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
